<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Nov.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released on Wednesday by the finance ministry showed non-residents were net buyers of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in November.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			   Nov     Oct     Nov 95</p>
<p>  - Direct investment			0.76    6.80    -1.85</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	 -8.55   -1.37   -11.00</p>
<p>     - Foreign investment in France    9.30    8.16     9.15</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT		    -31.96   -9.28    -8.25</p>
<p>  - Residents in foreign securities  -22.50    1.51   -21.50</p>
<p>     - shares				  0.30   -4.11     0.00</p>
<p>     - bonds				 -27.66   -8.11   -11.11</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	  5.35   13.63   -12.28</p>
<p>     - derivative products		-0.48    0.10     1.89</p>
<p>  - Non-residents in French securities-9.47  -10.78    13.25</p>
<p>     - shares				 10.13    4.98    -0.52</p>
<p>     - bonds				  -5.11  -11.53    12.91</p>
<p>	  -Govt securities (OATs, BTANs) 0.30  -10.56     9.00</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	-14.49   -4.24     0.86</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			  40.95  -13.65    22.22</p>
<p>  - Credits				   22.20   35.29   -61.92</p>
<p>  - Liabilities			     18.74  -48.94    84.14</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS			     -0.29   -0.42    -0.14</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		   9.46  -16.55    11.98</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
